# T-1154: [@Bool x] no longer binds x (x is Pattern::Pin — wildcard, no binding).
# Use a standalone [case [let x] x body] arm. The _: false arm is unreachable
# after the CaseArm (Wildcard sentinel covers all), producing the expected warning.
[match true
  [case [let x] x x]
  _: false]
=== out
Bool(true)

=== warn
[TypeError] unreachable match arm: this pattern is already covered by prior arms
